    "第4宫 家庭/根基": "4th House · Family / Roots",
    "第5宫 创造/恋爱": "5th House · Creativity / Romance",
    "第6宫 工作/健康": "6th House · Work / Health",
    "第7宫 伴侣/合作": "7th House · Partners / Cooperation",
    "第8宫 转化/共享": "8th House · Transformation / Sharing",
    "第9宫 哲学/远行": "9th House · Philosophy / Travel",
    "第10宫 事业/地位": "10th House · Career / Status",
