    "柔软、易共情": "Soft, easily empathic",
    "热情、敢冲，适合把冲劲切成可完成的小目标，避免虎头蛇尾。": "Passionate and bold — best to cut that drive into small, finishable goals and avoid starting strong and fading out.",
    "务实能守，适合长期积累与落地执行，小心别太固执、错过变化的信号。": "Practical and steady — suited to long-term accumulation and follow-through; beware of being too stubborn and missing signals of change.",
    "脑子活、善沟通，长于连接信息与人脉，注意想法多、落地少。": "Quick-minded and good with words, strong at connecting information and people — watch out for many ideas and little follow-through.",
    "感受力强，共情能力突出，宜管好情绪边界，别过度卷入他人的课题。": "Highly sensitive, with outstanding empathy — manage emotional boundaries and avoid getting pulled too far into other people's problems.",
    "开创力强，擅长起头、抢占先机，是团队里第一个举手的人，但容易虎头蛇尾，需要有人或制度帮忙盯后半程。": "Strong at starting things, good at seizing the initiative — the first to raise a hand in the team — but prone to fading out, and needs someone or some system to watch the second half.",
    "稳定持久，认定的事很难被动摇，擅长把事情做深做透，但也要提防过度固执、拒绝调整。": "Stable and enduring; once decided, hard to shake, and good at taking things deep — but beware of excess stubbornness and refusing to adjust.",
    "适应力强，善于随机应变、切换赛道，缺点是容易见异思迁，缺乏把事情收尾的耐心。": "Highly adaptable, good at improvising and switching tracks — the weakness is flitting between interests and lacking patience to finish things.",
    "火-基本": "Fire – Cardinal",
    "火借风势，始能燎原：开创之火最忌孤军奋战。把第一份热情分给同伴，星火方成大势。": "Fire needs wind to become a wildfire: pioneering fire must never fight alone. Share your first enthusiasm with companions, and sparks become a movement.",
    "火-固定": "Fire – Fixed",
    "此火如长明之灯：不在一时之烈，而在持久之暖。守住初心，便是一生最大的魔法。": "This fire is like a lamp that never goes out: its power is not in a moment's blaze but in lasting warmth. Hold to your first intention — it is the greatest magic of a lifetime.",
    "火-变动": "Fire – Mutable",
    "变动之火，如旷野流萤：宜把理想装进行囊，而非挂在嘴边。走出去，世界自会给你答案。": "Mutable fire is like fireflies in the open field: pack your ideals into your bag rather than wearing them on your lips. Go out, and the world will answer you.",
    "土-基本": "Earth – Cardinal",
    "开创之土，如高山奠基：慢工出细活，时间是最好的包浆。多年后回望，皆是勋章。": "Founding earth is like laying a mountain's foundation: slow work makes fine work, and time is the best polish. Years from now, it will all look like medals.",
    "土-固定": "Earth – Fixed",
    "固定之土，如沃野藏金：认定了便深耕不辍。然土太实则板结，宜偶尔松松土，让新风进来。": "Fixed earth is like gold hidden in rich soil: once decided, keep digging deep. But earth too solid turns hard — loosen it now and then and let fresh air in.",
    "土-变动": "Earth – Mutable",
    "变动之土，如良田轮作：于细微处见功夫。把挑剔炼成标准，便是封神之路。": "Mutable earth is like rotating crops in good fields: skill shows in the details. Turn pickiness into a standard, and that is the road to mastery.",
    "风-基本": "Air – Cardinal",
    "开创之风，如平湖初澜：为和谐而生，也为和谐而困。先安放好自己，再去平衡世界。": "Founding air is like the first ripple on a calm lake: born for harmony, and troubled by it too. Settle yourself first, then balance the world.",
    "风-固定": "Air – Fixed",
    "固定之风，如高空急流：独立是天赋，孤独是代价。找到同类，风便有了方向。": "Fixed air is like a high-altitude jet stream: independence is the gift, loneliness the price. Find your own kind, and the wind gains direction.",
    "风-变动": "Air – Mutable",
    "变动之风，如柳絮因风起：信息是养料，专注是根。把「知道」变成「做到」，方为智者。": "Mutable air is like willow fluff rising on the wind: information is nourishment, focus is root. Turning 'knowing' into 'doing' is what makes a wise person.",
    "水-基本": "Water – Cardinal",
    "开创之水，如源头活泉：以柔克刚，以情动人。先安顿情绪，再安顿人生。": "Founding water is like a spring at its source: softness overcomes hardness, feeling moves people. Settle your emotions first, then your life.",
    "水-固定": "Water – Fixed",
    "固定之水，如深潭藏龙：洞察是天赋，信任是修行。把控制换成边界，深情才有回响。": "Fixed water is like a dragon hidden in a deep pool: insight is the gift, trust the practice. Trade control for boundaries, and deep feeling finds its echo.",
    "水-变动": "Water – Mutable",
    "变动之水，如雾海行舟：共情是帆，边界是舵。有舵的船，才能到得了彼岸。": "Mutable water is like sailing a sea of fog: empathy is the sail, boundaries the rudder. Only a ship with a rudder reaches the far shore.",
    "盘中火象缺席：行动力不是本能反应，需要刻意给自己设短期截止日来「点火」，否则容易一直停在计划阶段。": "Fire is absent from the chart: drive is not instinctive — deliberately set short deadlines to 'light the fire', or you may stay stuck in the planning stage.",
    "盘中土象缺席：落地执行是相对弱项，想法常常很好但难持续推进，建议借助清单、伙伴或制度把创意变成现实。": "Earth is absent from the chart: follow-through is the weaker side — ideas are often good but hard to sustain, so use lists, partners, or systems to turn creativity into reality.",
    "盘中风象缺席：抽离、客观分析的视角较弱，遇事容易先讲情绪，可练习「先说事实、再说感受」的表达顺序。": "Air is absent from the chart: the detached, objective view is weaker, and feelings tend to come first — practise saying the facts first, then the feelings.",
    "盘中水象缺席：对情绪信号不够敏感，容易忽略自己和他人的感受，建议刻意练习共情与倾听。": "Water is absent from the chart: emotional signals are easily missed, in yourself and in others — deliberately practise empathy and listening.",
