    "太阳与月亮不同星座：外人眼中的你，和独处时的你可能有明显反差，这是正常的「表里两面」，不是矛盾。": "The Sun and Moon are in different signs: how others see you and how you are alone may differ noticeably. This is a normal 'two sides' — not a contradiction.",
    "太阳与月亮同星座：表里高度一致，情绪与目标常同步，决策也更干脆利落。": "The Sun and Moon share a sign: inner and outer are highly consistent, feelings and goals usually move together, and decisions come more cleanly.",
    "上升与太阳同星座：第一印象就是本色出演，辨识度高。": "Rising and Sun share a sign: your first impression is your true self, and highly distinctive.",
    "上升与月亮同星座：初次见面就能感受到你的情绪底色，亲和力强。": "Rising and Moon share a sign: people sense your emotional tone at first meeting, and you come across warmly.",
