    "组），人生更像「顺风张帆」，天赋帮你省了不少力气，风险是容易因为太顺而怠惰、不逼自己成长。": "Overall resistance: hard and soft aspects are roughly balanced; life has both resistance and support, the pace is relatively steady, and progress depends on your own choices.",
