    "：这是外界眼中你职业形象的底色，找工作、立人设时可以参考。": ": this is the base tone of how the outside world sees your professional image — useful when job-hunting or shaping your public persona.",
    "补全出生地后，可看到事业宫（第10宫）星座，让职业形象定位更精准。": "Once you add your birthplace, you will see the sign of your career house (10th house) for a sharper professional positioning.",
    "土星在": "Saturn is in ",
    "：现实会在这个领域反复考验你，熬过去往往就是你中年后最扎实的专业壁垒。": ": reality will test you repeatedly in this area — getting through it usually becomes your most solid professional strength after middle age.",
    "木星在": "Jupiter is in ",
    "：这是学习、贵人与机会容易靠近的方向，值得主动伸手争取。": ": this is where learning, mentors, and opportunities come easily — worth reaching for.",
    "实操建议：把太阳特质当职业标签对外介绍，把土星领域当长期深耕的根据地，把木星领域当找机会、找老师的方向。": "Practical advice: present your Sun traits as your professional label, treat your Saturn area as the ground for long-term depth, and treat your Jupiter area as where to look for opportunities and mentors.",
    "金星在": "Venus is in ",
    "：这是你真正愿意为之付钱、也容易因此被钱吸引的价值偏好。": ": this is the value you are genuinely willing to pay for — and the one money tends to follow.",
    "财帛宫（第2宫）落在": "The money house (2nd house) falls in ",
    "：反映你赚钱与花钱的本能风格。": ": this reflects your instinctive style of earning and spending.",
    "补全出生地后，可看到财帛宫（第2宫）星座。": "Once you add your birthplace, you will see the sign of your money house (2nd house).",
    "第8宫落在": "The 8th house falls in ",
    "：涉及合作资金、债务与他人资源，是「共同财务」课题的所在。": ": this covers shared money, debts, and other people's resources — the 'joint finances' theme.",
    "木星恰好触及财务相关宫位：扩张财运的窗口值得抓，但忌贪多嚼不烂、赌性过重。": "Jupiter happens to touch a finance-related house: the window for expanding your income is worth seizing — but avoid biting off more than you can chew or gambling too hard.",
    "财运节奏偏平稳积累型，靠技能与信用比靠运气更稳。": "Your money rhythm leans toward steady accumulation — skill and reputation serve you better than luck.",
    "土象力量偏强：比起追逐高回报，你更倾向把钱换成看得见、摸得着的资产，守成能力强。": "Earth is strong: rather than chasing high returns, you prefer turning money into tangible assets — a strong keeper of what you have.",
    "火象强而土象缺席：赚钱冲劲十足，但落袋为安的耐心不够，宜找个务实的搭档或工具帮忙管钱。": "Fire is strong and earth is absent: you earn with great drive, but lack patience for banking the gains — find a practical partner or tool to help manage the money.",
    "情感安全感的根基已由月亮": "The foundation of your emotional security has already been set by the Moon ",
    "决定（详见「一、核心三轴」），这里聚焦你在关系里的实际互动方式。": "(see 'I. The Three Core Axes'); here we focus on how you actually interact in relationships.",
    "伴侣宫（第7宫）落在": "The partnership house (7th house) falls in ",
    "：暗示你容易被什么样的人吸引，也容易在关系里扮演什么角色。": ": this hints at the kind of person you are drawn to, and the role you tend to play in relationships.",
    "补全出生地后，可看到伴侣宫（第7宫）星座，进一步定位择偶倾向。": "Once you add your birthplace, you will see the sign of your partnership house (7th house) to pinpoint your partner preferences further.",
    "也会影响你留给对方的第一印象（详见「一」）。": "It also shapes the first impression you leave on the other person (see 'I').",
    "决定你追求与争吵时的动作，完整解读见「九、行动张力」。": "It drives how you pursue and how you argue; see 'IX. Action Tension' for the full reading.",
    "水象偏多：容易共情、也容易在关系中过度牺牲，宜练习设定情感边界。": "Water runs high: empathy comes easily, but so does over-sacrificing in relationships — practise setting emotional boundaries.",
    "火象偏多：主动直接、追求效率，记得给关系留一点耐心和缓冲。": "Fire runs high: direct and efficiency-driven — remember to leave relationships some patience and breathing room.",
    "土象偏多：重视承诺与实际付出，表达爱的方式偏行动派而非甜言蜜语。": "Earth runs high: commitment and real effort matter most, and love is shown through actions rather than sweet words.",
    "感情节奏建议先安顿好月亮的安全感，再展现金星的魅力。": "For the rhythm of love: settle the Moon's need for security first, then show the Venus charm.",
