    "把水星（怎么想）、金星（喜欢什么）、火星（怎么做）连起来看，就是你从想法到行动的完整链路。": "Read Mercury (how you think), Venus (what you like), and Mars (how you act) together, and you get the full chain from idea to action.",
    "能量融合、同一主题被放大，天赋与执念常一体两面。": "Energies fuse and one theme is amplified; talent and fixation are often two sides of the same coin.",
    "轻松的机会与助力，主动伸手时更易接通。": "Easy opportunities and support, more readily available when you reach out.",
    "摩擦与压力，逼你做选择、练能力，短期不舒服、长期长本事。": "Friction and pressure that force choices and build ability — uncomfortable in the short term, strengthening in the long term.",
    "自然流畅的才能通道，做起来相对顺，也容易吃老本。": "A naturally smooth channel for talent — things come relatively easily, though it is easy to rest on past gains.",
    "拉锯与平衡题，人生常在两极之间找中线。": "A push-and-pull question of balance; life often means finding the middle between two poles.",
    "<div class=\"w-line\">本盘主要相位较少或较宽，性格弹性大，外在事件驱动会更明显。</div>": "<div class=\"w-line\">This chart has few major aspects, or wide ones — the character is flexible, and outer events drive things more noticeably.</div>",
    "<div class=\"w-sub\">最值得盯的相位（按紧密度）</div>": "<div class=\"w-sub\">Aspects most worth watching (by tightness)</div>",
    "这两颗星的主题会反复在生活里「绑在一起」出现。</div>": "The themes of these two planets will keep appearing in life 'tied together'.</div>",
    "<div class=\"w-line\">读法提示：合/拱/六分偏顺风；刑/对偏功课。顺风要主动用，功课要拆小步做，不要硬刚。</div>": "<div class=\"w-line\">How to read this: conjunctions, trines, and sextiles lean favourable; squares and oppositions lean lessons. Use the favourable winds actively; break lessons into small steps — don't force your way through.</div>",
    "<div class=\"w-sub\">整宫制：上升": "<div class=\"w-sub\">Whole Sign: the rising sign is ",
    "为第1宫，十二个人生舞台一览</div>": " the 1st house — a tour of the twelve stages of life</div>",
    "<div class=\"w-sub\">重点参考：1/10宫看形象与事业方向，7宫看一对一关系，2/8宫看钱与深层联结，5宫看恋爱与创造欲。": "<div class=\"w-sub\">Key references: the 1st/10th houses for image and career direction, the 7th for one-to-one relationships, the 2nd/8th for money and deep bonds, the 5th for love and creativity.",
    "<div class=\"w-line\">填写出生地经纬度后，可生成上升与十二宫生活舞台解读。</div>": "<div class=\"w-line\">Add your birthplace latitude and longitude to generate rising-sign and twelve-house life-stage readings.</div>",
    "：这是你最容易感到「压力大、成长也最扎实」的领域，心理功课多围绕「够不够格、值不值得」展开，扎实面对比逃避更省力。": ": this is the area where you most easily feel 'stressed, yet growing most solidly' — the inner work circles around 'am I good enough, am I worthy', and facing it squarely costs less than avoiding it.",
    "天王星在": "Uranus is in ",
    "海王星在": "Neptune is in ",
    "冥王星在": "Pluto is in ",
    "提示：天王/海王/冥王星移动极慢，星座本身是「整代人」共有的印记，真正个人化的是它们所落的宫位——那才是这份世代议题在你身上展开的具体舞台。": "Note: Uranus, Neptune, and Pluto move extremely slowly, so their signs are a shared mark of a whole generation — what makes them personal is the house they fall in, the actual stage where this generational theme plays out in your life.",
    "幸福倾向：": "Happiness tendency: ",
    "算法参考：和谐相位、日月是否同调、水象感受力与土象落地是否兼顾。": "Based on: harmonious aspects, whether Sun and Moon are in tune, and whether water's feeling and earth's grounding are both present.",
    "麻将手气：": "Mahjong luck: ",
