    "/5）　牌风：": "/5)　Play style: ",
    "木星与火风偏多时临场更「活」；土星压娱乐宫则宜稳打少贪。": "With Jupiter and plenty of fire and air, you play more 'alive' in the moment; with Saturn pressing the house of fun, play steady and don't get greedy.",
    "这两项都是盘面「体感倾向」，不是宿命——睡眠、关系与牌桌选择影响更大。": "Both of these are 'felt tendencies' from the chart, not fate — sleep, relationships, and table choice matter more.",
