    "云开雾散月重明\n一洗尘埃万里清\n前程自有通衢路\n莫向歧途问姓名": "The clouds part, the mist lifts, the moon shines bright again\nAll dust washed away, ten thousand li lie clear\nAhead, a broad highway awaits your way\nSeek not your name upon a wayward path",
    "守正待时，吉自天来": "Hold Fast and Wait; Good Fortune Comes of Itself",
    "出行 洽谈": "Travel, Negotiation",
    "急躁 口舌": "Haste, Quarrels",
    "一枝新绿破春寒\n莫道前途多险滩\n贵人暗中相指引\n秋来果熟满庭欢": "One sprig of new green breaks the cold of spring\nSay not the road ahead is all rough shoals\nA noble helper guides you from the shadows\nWhen autumn comes, ripe fruit fills the courtyard with joy",
    "先难后易，贵人暗助": "Hard First, Then Easy; a Noble Helper Lends Aid",
    "求学 结交": "Study, Making Friends",
    "投机 远行": "Speculation, Long Journeys",
    "静水深流最有情\n不争不抢自安宁\n家中和气财源聚\n笑看浮云过太清": "Still waters run deepest, and kindest too\nStrive not, snatch not, and peace will be yours\nHarmony at home gathers wealth to your door\nSmile as drifting clouds pass the highest sky",
    "以静制动，家和事兴": "Stillness Masters Motion; a Harmonious Home Brings Prosperity",
    "守成 团聚": "Preserving What You Have, Family Reunion",
    "争执 借贷": "Arguments, Borrowing",
    "马蹄得意过长安\n春风十里尽开颜\n此去前程多锦绣\n珍惜当下莫等闲": "Proud hooves carry you through Chang'an\nTen li of spring breeze set every face alight\nAhead, a future rich with brocade\nTreasure the present; do not let it idly pass",
    "顺风顺水，宜进取": "Smooth Sailing; Time to Press Ahead",
    "开业 签约": "Opening a Business, Signing Contracts",
    "懈怠 拖延": "Idleness, Delay",
    "山重水复疑无路\n柳暗花明又一村\n转机只在方寸间\n回首方知步步春": "Hills upon hills, waters upon waters — no road in sight\nThen willows darken, blossoms brighten — another village appears\nThe turning point lies within a single thought\nLook back, and every step was spring",
    "困境将解，转机在即": "The Impasse Is Lifting; a Turning Point Is Near",
